          <h2 class="max-w-xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] text-zinc-950 sm:text-4xl">
            Embed, share, and keep it private.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">
            Add the calculator to your running, sleep, or workforce article. All calculations happen in the visitor's browser, so no time data is uploaded or stored.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-0 grid gap-4">
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950">Embed code</h3>
            <pre class="mt-4 w-full max-w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-emerald-100"><code class="block whitespace-pre-wrap break-all">&lt;iframe src="https://average-time-calculator.com/embed" width="100%" height="720" loading="lazy" title="Average Time Calculator"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;</code></pre>
            <button type="button" id="copy-embed-code" class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-emerald-700 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-800 active:translate-y-px">
